      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hey, I'm working on a protocol for an international shipment of mRNA vaccines. We need to ensure the cold chain stays intact from the manufacturing site to the distribution hubs in Southeast Asia. Can you give me a high-level checklist of the essential requirements and monitoring steps we need to have in place to prevent any thermal excursions during transit?",
